    "Geometry / Mesh": "几何体 / 网格",
    "Flipped Geometry": "已翻转几何体",
    "Generates parametric architectural grid axes (structural gridlines) from lists of\nspacing distances between consecutive X and Y axes.\nConnect directly to Panel nodes (multi-line or comma-separated numbers) or numeric lists.\nOutputs axis curves (X lines, Y lines), bubble markers, intersection points for columns/foundations, and a 3D wireframe mesh.": "根据连续 X 轴和 Y 轴之间的间距列表生成参数化建筑轴网（结构定位轴线）。\n可直接连接到面板节点（多行或逗号分隔的数值）或数字列表。\n输出轴网曲线（X 线、Y 线）、轴号圈、立柱/基础交点以及三维线框网格。",
    "Generates a watertight monolithic concrete stair flight.": "生成无缝实心整体混凝土现浇楼梯跑段。",
    "Generates 3D watertight parametric hip roofs via Straight Skeleton from any boundary contour or referenced face, with optional courtyard/interior holes.\nSupports both horizontal roofs and sloped/tilted 3D surfaces.": "通过直线骨架算法从任意边界轮廓或参考面生成三维无缝参数化四坡屋顶，支持内部天井/庭院洞口。\n同时支持水平屋顶和倾斜三维表面。",
    "Generates a 3D watertight solid floor slab or foundation from a boundary curve.": "根据边界曲线生成三维无缝实心楼板或建筑基础。",
    "Extrudes a 2D polyline or curve into 3D watertight solid walls with thickness and height.": "将二维折线或曲线沿高度方向拉伸，生成具有厚度和高度的三维实心墙体。",
    "Generates a closed circular polyline curve and optional planar face.": "生成闭合圆形折线曲线及可选的平面面网格。",
    "Generates an elliptical polyline with independent X and Y radii.": "生成具有独立 X 和 Y 半径的椭圆形折线曲线。",
    "Generates a planar 2D/3D polygon face mesh from boundary vertices and optional hole loops.": "根据边界顶点及可选的内孔环生成平面二维/三维多边形面网格。",
    "Generates a structural steel I-beam or H-profile cross section.": "生成结构型钢工字钢或 H 型钢横截面。",
    "Generates an architectural or structural L-shape polyline.": "生成建筑或结构专用的 L 型截面折线。",
    "Generates a straight 3D line curve connecting start point A and end point B.": "生成连接起点 A 和终点 B 的直线三维曲线段。",
    "Extracts vertices or boundary points from any input curve or surface / planar mesh.": "从任意输入的曲线、曲面或平面网格中提取顶点或边界点。",
    "Generates a regular polygon (triangle, pentagon, hexagon, octagon, etc.).": "生成正多边形曲线（三角形、五边形、六边形、八边形等）。",
    "Generates a rectangular polyline with optional rounded fillet corners.": "生成带可选圆角倒角的矩形折线曲线。",
    "Generates a pill / stadium / elongated slot polyline.": "生成胶囊形 / 体育场形 / 跑道形拉长槽孔折线曲线。",
    "Generates a 2D or 3D Archimedean spiral or helical stair path.": "生成二维或三维阿基米德螺旋线或旋转楼梯螺旋路径。",
    "Generates an n-pointed parametric star polyline.": "生成参数化 N 角星形折线曲线。",
    "Samples an image file (PNG/JPG/BMP) or procedural ripple to produce a 3D terrain\ndisplacement mesh, point cloud, and brightness values (0.0 to 1.0).\nClick '🖼️ Select Image' on the node card to pick a file from disk.": "采样图像文件（PNG/JPG/BMP）或程序化波纹，生成三维地形置换网格、点云及亮度值（0.0 至 1.0）。\n点击节点卡片上的 '🖼️ 选择图片' 即可从磁盘选取文件。",
    "Integer number slider with customizable limits and step value.": "具备自定义上限、下限和步长值的整数数值滑块。",
    "Floating-point number slider with decimal precision and customizable limits.": "具备小数精度和自定义上下限的浮点数数值滑块。",
    "Grasshopper-style multi-line data inspector and input panel.\n• When wired: acts as a data viewer, formatting items with indices [0], [1]...\n• When unwired: type multi-line numbers, text, or coordinates (x, y, z) to output as lists.": "Grasshopper 风格的多行数据查看与输入面板。\n• 连接时：作为数据查看器，按 [0]、[1]... 显示条目索引。\n• 未连接时：输入多行数字、文本或坐标 (x, y, z) 输出为列表。",
    "Text string input or constant.": "文本字符串输入或固定文本常量。",
    "Sleek Grasshopper-style boolean switch. Click the button to toggle between True and False.": "精美易用的 Grasshopper 风格布尔开关。点击按钮在 True（真）和 False（假）之间切换。",
    "Assigns a material (Glass, Wood, Aluminum, Concrete, etc.), color, and opacity\nto geometry. When multiple parts are merged into an assembly (window, door),\neach part preserves its material and transparency when baked to IngeTrazo.": "为几何体赋予材质（玻璃、木材、铝合金、混凝土等）、颜色和不透明度。\n当多个零件合并为装配件（如门窗）时，每个零件在烘焙至 IngeTrazo 时均完整保留其材质和透明度属性。",
    "Defines an RGB color tuple (0.0 to 1.0) and hex code.": "定义 RGB 颜色元组 (0.0 至 1.0) 及对应的十六进制颜色代码。",
    "Combines separate parts (e.g. glass panes and wood frames) into a single assembly.\nPreserves each part's assigned material, color, and opacity so the entire assembly\nbakes cleanly into IngeTrazo as a multi-material window, door, or architectural element.": "将独立零件（如玻璃面板与木制窗框）组合为一个统一的装配件。\n完整保留每个零件所赋予的材质、颜色与不透明度，使整个组件能作为多材质门窗或建筑构件干净地烘焙至 IngeTrazo 中。",
    "Adds numbers, vectors, or lists.": "将数字、向量或列表相加。",
    "Performs Cartesian cross-referencing between two lists.": "在两个列表之间执行笛卡尔积全组合交叉引用。",
    "Divides input A by input B.": "将输入 A 除以输入 B。",
    "Divides a numeric range or interval into N equal steps.": "将指定数值区间等分为 N 个相等的步进段。",
    "Evaluates a mathematical formula expression f(x, y).": "计算并求值自定义二元数学表达式 f(x, y)。",
    "Multiplies numbers, vectors, or lists.": "将数字、向量或列表相乘。",
    "Generates an arithmetic series of numbers.": "生成指定步长和数量的等差数列。",
    "Subtracts input B from input A.": "从输入 A 中减去输入 B。",
    "Reverses the face winding / normal orientation of a 3D mesh (turning inside-out),\nor reverses the direction of a curve.": "反转三维网格面的缠绕方向/法线朝向（使内外翻转），或反转曲线的前进方向。",
    "Exports geometry and assemblies to the IngeTrazo 3D scene with BIM metadata (IfcColumn, IfcWall, etc.).": "将几何体和组合部件导出至 IngeTrazo 三维场景，并附带专业 BIM 分类元数据（IfcColumn 柱、IfcWall 墙体等）。",
    "Reference a face or surface from the IngeTrazo 3D viewport into the node graph.\nClick '📌 Set Selected Face' on the node card to store the currently selected face.\nAutomatically extracts the outer perimeter and all courtyard/interior holes.\nThe referenced face is saved directly in the file (.itgraph) so it is remembered\nwhen reopening.": "将 IngeTrazo 三维视口中的指定面或表面引用至节点图表中。\n点击节点卡片上的 '📌 设置选中的面' 即可存储当前选定的面。\n自动提取外周长轮廓及所有内部中庭孔洞。\n引用的面直接保存在项目文件 (.itgraph) 中，重新打开时完整保留。",
    "Generates a 3D watertight cuboid / box solid.": "生成三维无缝实心六面体立方体 / 长方体。",
    "Generates a 3D watertight cylinder or architectural column solid.": "生成三维无缝实心圆柱体或建筑圆形立柱。",
    "Extrudes any 2D closed curve or polygon into a 3D watertight solid with capped ends.": "将任意闭合二维曲线或多边形拉伸为带有封闭端盖的三维实心无缝几何体。",
    "Joins a list of meshes into a single combined watertight mesh.": "将多个网格列表拼合为一个完整的三维组合无缝网格。",
    "Generates a 3D mesh surface from a grid or array of points.": "根据二维网格点阵生成三维空间网格表面。",
    "Creates a watertight cylindrical pipe or hollow tube solid along rail curve(s).\nUses rotation-minimizing parallel transport frames to avoid twisting.\nSupports radius, wall thickness, radial segments, and capping options.": "沿轨道引导曲线生成实心无缝圆柱管道或中空管道实体。\n采用旋转最小化平行输送坐标架（RMF），避免沿路径发生扭曲。\n支持设定外半径、管壁厚度、圆周分段数及端部封盖选项。",
    "Revolves a 2D profile curve around the Z axis into a 3D solid.": "将二维截面曲线绕 Z 轴环绕旋转成型为三维旋转体实体。",
    "Generates a 3D watertight UV sphere solid.": "生成三维经纬度 UV 无缝实心球体。",
    "Sweeps a 2D/3D profile curve along a rail trajectory path using rotation-minimizing\nparallel transport frames to produce a smooth watertight solid or tubular surface.\nSupports open or closed profiles and paths, with automatic start and end capping.": "使用旋转最小化平行输送坐标系将截面曲线沿导轨轨迹扫掠，生成平滑无扭曲的实心体或管状曲面。\n支持开式或闭式截面与路径，并具备起始端与终止端自动封盖功能。",
    "Merges multiple solids or meshes into a single compound geometry.": "将多个实体或网格通过布尔并集融合为单一复合几何体。",
    "Applies translation, rotation, and uniform scaling to 3D geometry.": "对三维几何体综合施加空间平移、旋转及等比例缩放变换。",
    "Deconstructs a point or vector into its X, Y, Z coordinate components.": "将点或向量解构为其独立的 X、Y、Z 坐标数值分量。",
    "Calculates Euclidean distance between two points.": "计算空间中两个点之间的欧几里得直线距离。",
    "Generates a 2D regular grid of points with spacing and counts.": "按照指定的间距与轴向数量生成二维规则平面点阵。",
    "Performs vector arithmetic (Addition, Subtraction, Dot Product, Cross Product, Normalization).": "执行三维向量代数运算（向量加法、减法、点积、叉积及向量归一化）。",
    "Constructs an orthonormal 3D plane coordinate system from an origin point and normal vector.\nEmits origin, unit normal, unit U (X-axis in plane), unit V (Y-axis in plane), a visual preview rectangle, and a plane dictionary.": "根据原点和法线向量构建正交标准三维平面坐标系统。\n输出平面原点、单位法线、面内 U 轴（X 轴基矢）、面内 V 轴（Y 轴基矢）、平面矩形预览及平面属性字典。",
    "Constructs a 3D point from X, Y, Z coordinates.": "根据指定的 X、Y、Z 坐标数值构建空间三维点。",
    "Duplicates geometry N times along a step vector.": "沿指定的增量步进向量将几何体线性复制重复 N 次。",
    "Moves 3D geometry or points by translation vector (dX, dY, dZ).": "根据平移增量向量 (dX, dY, dZ) 空间位移三维几何体或点集。",
    "Duplicates geometry N times in a circular radial pattern around an origin.": "围绕指定中心原点以圆周径向环形排列方式将几何体复制 N 次。",
    "Rotates 3D geometry around Z axis by angle in degrees.": "将三维几何体围绕竖直 Z 轴旋转指定角度（角度制）。",
