    "Extrudes any 2D planar face, surface, or annular frame (including holes) into a watertight 3D solid with capped ends.": "将任何二维平面、曲面或环形边框（包含开孔）拉伸为封闭的平滑三维实体。",
    "Preview": "预览",
    "Clean, lightweight viewport visualizer.\nConnect any geometry (Mesh, Curve, Surface, Solids) to preview it immediately in the IngeTrazo 3D viewport.\nNo BIM properties, no group names, no bake buttons: purely a visual geometry preview.": "轻量纯净的视口几何预览节点。\n连接任何几何体（网格、曲线、曲面、实体）即可在 IngeTrazo 3D 视口中即时预览。\n无需 BIM 属性、组名或烘焙按钮：纯粹的实时视觉几何预览。"
  }
